Hi Lisa,

Following up on the 04/15/2026 call -- the software update for the V10 GCX
(SN D0010) is ready and addresses the "84648" waveform-window error you
saw after the overpressure event on 04/09/2026.

*To install*

    1. Close VasoGuard if it's open.
    2. Run the updater linked at the bottom of this email.
    3. Reboot.
    4. Run a quick test ABI to confirm waveforms render correctly.

If anything looks off after the update, reply to this email or reopen
ticket #092693 and we'll get on it the same day.

Once you're stable, two quick asks:

- *Cuff stock*  -- it's been a while since your last cuff order. Want me
  to put together a standing-order quote for the next 12 months?

- *Reference*  -- if the V10 has been working well at Wyandot since the
  install, would you be open to a 5-minute customer-quote we could
  feature on corvascular.com? No pressure either way.

Thanks for being patient on this one.

Spencer

Update download: https://corvascular.com/customer-portal/v10-update
Ticket: https://corvascular.com/admin/support/092693

